{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2>In the not-so-far future, you are hired by a mysterious Benefactor to take part in a simulation to protect self-aware Constructs from a mysterious Corrupted army seeking to use the Constructs for their own schemes. Battle enemies in lore-based cyberspace tower (or WALL) defense and find out more about the world your in... and the world outside.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend</h2>Defend your FIREWALL from a steadily strengthening army of Corrupted, each with their own stats and some with special abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade</h2>Upgrade in many ways, some requiring XP, others requiring money to upgrade yourself to your fullest potential, whether upgrading through the SKILL Tree, empowering your turrets, or adding effects to your ICE.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lore</h2>Find or buy pieces of lore earnable in a variety of ways to know more about the simulated world and its Benefactor and take part in a story arc opening the question of who the Corrupted are.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AVATAR</h2>Choose between five characters with different attacks and their own stats, dependent on who they are and upgrade them to have powerful abilities, not to mention change your characters looks a little.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Items</h2>Find or buy items that can upgrade your ICE, empower you temporarily, or even change the music that plays while you battle!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>Talk to characters and cause an impact that can affect your experience with them later.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859670/178ec20f039b5cdc56e28d24d4601bb342663278.jpg"},{"name":"Delta Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859670/f36d28ba831a694a8a7c6892211b8ef2538658e9.jpg"},{"name":"Benefit of the Doubt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859670/87cd825efe757f55923e9